// Generated by uison-gen (crates/uison-gen) — don't edit by hand.
//
//   Column({.gap = 12, .children = {Text("Hello", {.size = 20}), Button("+1", {.on_click = inc})}})
//
// Fields go in declaration order (otherwise GCC and MSVC won't compile it): own properties → sizes
// (w, h, flex, margin…) → common (key, visible, disabled, tooltip…) → events → child/children.
// Any other property — via a chain: Text("…").prop("name", value).
